    "restoration_notes": "Premium tropical fruit tree with exceptional commercial value. Integrates well into cacao agroforestry systems after the establishment phase. Requires shade during early growth but develops into a large canopy tree. Suitable for riparian landscapes because mature trees tolerate occasional flooding. Because of its long juvenile period, grafted material is recommended whenever available. Within FYNOS AI, mangosteen is recommended as a complementary high-value productive species rather than a core native Amazon restoration species."
